WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.020
Hey David, this is a funny question.

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:07.560
Hey David, can you tell us the truth about
what's going on with your belly button?

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:14.340
I know people who had appendectomies and very
strange things happened to their belly buttons.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:15.580
Can you come clean?

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.090
All right.

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:20.990
This is sort of weird and personal, but I
will briefly mention it.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:24.450
Maybe this is not the right story to listen
to if you're having breakfast or something

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:25.450
right now.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.700
So on October 2nd I had an emergency appendectomy.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:34.800
They tend to always be emergencies as far
as I know, and it was fortunately laparoscopic

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.450
rather than an open of my uh, abdomen.

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:41.960
This means that three small incisions are
made indeed.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:45.490
One of those incisions was just below my belly
button.

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:50.579
That is the one according to my surgeon who
was great, who said, and again this I, I'm

00:00:50.579 --> 00:00:51.870
going into detail here.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:56.200
He said, that is the incision through which
the appendix is removed.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:00.860
There is no doubt that after, in fact, when
I was still sort of on anesthesia, I remember

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:05.040
lifting my shirt and looking down to see what
was going on and it was not good.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.649
My entire stomach had been shaved.

00:01:07.649 --> 00:01:13.119
I had a surgical glue and stitches and it
was, it was crazy.

00:01:13.119 --> 00:01:18.170
Uh, but I'll tell you the truth, I was convinced
my belly button would remain looking very,

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:24.460
very different forever because it looked so
different after the, um, the, the surgery,

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:30.679
it turns out that like 90% of it was just
the surgical glue that they use, which has

00:01:30.679 --> 00:01:34.420
kind of a purple color as that fell off.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:40.009
And again, I apologize if it's too much information
here, but people ask as that fell off, uh,

00:01:40.009 --> 00:01:42.020
the belly buttons really looking pretty good.

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:47.389
You still see the incision, of course, it's
totally scarred over at this point and it

00:01:47.389 --> 00:01:50.679
still hurts the tiniest bit sometimes in certain
positions.

00:01:50.679 --> 00:01:55.170
But now that the hair has grown back in, I'm
really pretty pleased I have to say with how

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:56.689
my, uh, belly button is looking.

00:01:56.689 --> 00:02:03.849
Thank you to the have very good handiwork
of, uh, dr Matthew NAES over at Faulkner hospital

00:02:03.849 --> 00:02:06.719
in Boston because you really did a very good
job.

00:02:06.719 --> 00:02:12.000
Uh, and I, the, the belly button is looking
fine, so I appreciate the concern.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:18.420
Assuming that this was not a trolling question
and, um, it's kind of weird, uh, to even be

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:19.770
going in this direction.

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:23.390
But that is the answer and I have nothing
else to say about it and don't know that I

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:25.140
will have anything more in the future.

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:28.590
We've got a great bonus show for you today,
producer Pat.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:32.110
Taking the reins of the Friday bonus show,
we will see you then.

